(Section 1: Infrastructure and Subservice Organizations) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Acme Corp relies on Amazon Web Services \(AWS\) and Google Cloud) Tj T*
(Platform \(GCP\) as its infrastructure providers. No other cloud) Tj T*
(providers are used to host production workloads.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
