(Section 2: Incident Response and Customer Notification) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Acme Corp maintains formally defined criteria for notifying) Tj T*
(customers of any security incident affecting the confidentiality,) Tj T*
(integrity or availability of their data. Affected customers are) Tj T*
(notified within 24 hours of incident confirmation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 3: Monitoring) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The service is monitored using Application Performance Monitoring) Tj T*
